个下人照顾她。每个月的生活费都交给了那两个下人，因为以前的诸葛明月是个自卑的人，所以也不敢去计较这些。那两个下人就奴大欺主，欺瞒下了不少钱。给诸葛明月的伙食基本都是素菜清汤。今早忙着来参加召唤仪式，就没空处理这事。等会回去再收拾这两个胆大包天的下人。诸葛明月暗下决心。“不，不谢。”万俟辰憨憨的笑了起来，“多吃点啊。你那么瘦，多吃点。”“好，我打包你不介意吧？”诸葛明月问的一本正经。“啊？不，不介意。”万俟辰先是一愣，接着用力的摇头。薛子皓把脸别到一边去了，实在不忍再看万俟辰那丢脸的样子了。很快菜一道道的上来了，诸葛明月开始动筷子了。万俟辰和薛子皓愣住了，因为诸葛明月的动作十分的优雅。这与他们认知的那个诸葛明月完全不同。以前在学校的食堂见过她吃饭的，她总是一个人端着餐盘缩到角落里去扒饭。和优雅两字完全不沾边。可是，现在的诸葛明月举手投足之间，都是优雅十足，甚至有些让人移不开眼神。只不过，优雅的动作，不优雅的食量……诸葛明月优雅的一连干了好几道菜，三碗饭这才停了下来。放下筷子后，优雅的擦了擦嘴，冲万俟辰嫣然一笑：“胖子，谢谢。”“不，不谢。”万俟辰都快傻了。“那我走了啊。”诸葛明月提起已经打包好的菜，冲万俟辰和薛子皓告别。“明天早上，我我去你家门口等你啊。”万俟辰急忙说道。“好。”诸葛明月点头，提着菜直接回家去了。万俟辰趴在窗口，看着外面诸葛明月的背影，出神。“喂，胖子，你不会被虐狂吧？被她打一顿，你就喜欢上她了？”一边的薛子皓终于忍不住开口问出心底的疑惑了。“胡说八道！你才是被虐狂。我懒得鸟你。”万俟辰跳脚脸憋的通红，“我要回去练习我的召唤术了，明天通过考核我就是正统的召唤师了。你回去练你的箭术去，作为我的守护师，你丫可别丢我的脸。”薛子皓嘴角一抽，道：“放心。倒是你，别明天召唤不出来。要是你参加个几次初级召唤师的考核，那我会笑死的。”“你做梦啊！”万俟辰哼唧了句，“明天就看我惊天地泣鬼神的表现吧！”“好了，走吧，回去回去。”薛子皓伸手勾过万俟辰的脖子，“你回去好好睡一觉，养足精神，明天我等着看你惊天地泣鬼神的表现呢。”“那是当然……”万俟辰得意的哼唧着，两人结账后，渐渐走远。这个时候的诸葛明月拎着吃的，正悠闲的往家里走。她现在住的房子，是诸葛家在苍枫城给她买的一个小四合院。她住在最中间的那间屋，两个下人，住在左边。一进大门，诸葛明月看着满院子的落叶，墙边摆放杂乱的花盆，就皱起了眉头。在记忆中，这两人，多久才打扫一次卫生？一周？一个月？就在诸葛明月思索的时候，有个下人走了出来。这个人是诸葛家雇用来照顾她起居的刘婶。刘婶一看到诸葛明月回来，只是淡淡的扫了一眼，就准备走开。但是忽然她鼻子抽了抽，闻到了香味。她猛然看向诸葛明月手中的油纸袋，眼睛有些放光起来。笑嘻嘻的朝诸葛明月走了来。“小姐，你还给我们带吃的回来啊，真是太好了！”说完，那刘婶就要伸手去拿诸葛明月手里的东西。诸葛明月脸色一沉，心中冷哼一声。这两人，早就欠收拾了！今天就收拾他们！－－－－－－题外话－－－－－－不出意外，这个文的更新会在每天上午11点。", "source": "www.quanwenyuedu.io", "source_url": "https://www.quanwenyuedu.io/n/fuheikuangnu-qingchengzhaohuanshi/6.html", "_fixed": true, "content_en": "Chapter 6 I refuse to give my back to people like you. Everyone, including Ling Feiyang himself, thinks the answer will be yes. However, the results are often surprising. \"No.\" Zhuge Mingyue's tone was very calm. \"What?\" Ling Feiyang didn't recover for a while. \"You don't have that honor! It's just me who refuses. Do you understand? Do you need me to make it clearer?\" Zhuge Mingyue said slowly with a calm face, \"I refuse to hand my back to someone like you. To someone who I don't trust and who doesn't trust me.\" Ling Feiyang's sexy thin lips were slightly opened, and she was dumbfounded. Zhuge Mingyue's answer was completely beyond his expectation! Luo Jingfeng also arrived at this time and heard the conversation between the two people. He raised his eyebrows slightly and looked at Zhuge Mingyue's calm face. He fell silent, but his heart was complicated. Wan Qichen and Xue Zihao stared at this scene with wide eyes. What happened just now? Zhuge Mingyue didn't care about this. Instead, he turned to look at Wan Qichen and smiled slightly: \"Fat man, didn't you just say you would treat me to a meal later? Let's go.\" \"Ah? Oh, uh-huh, I'm treating you to a meal!\" Wan Qichen came back to his senses and nodded repeatedly with joy. \"Then let's go.\" Zhuge Mingyue smiled brightly, let go of her hand, and the fat parrot in his hand flew to her head and squatted down. Before leaving, the fat parrot used its small eyes to look at Ling Feiyang with contempt, who was still petrified in place and unable to accept the reality. Just like that, under the surprised, shocked and puzzled eyes of everyone, Zhuge Mingyue, Wan Qichen and Xue Zihao walked out of the college gate. Ling Feiyang, however, had not recovered yet and stood there in a daze. Luo Jingfeng shrugged, stepped forward and patted him on the shoulder: \"Feiyang, wake up, everyone is gone.\" Ling Feiyang came back to his senses and quickly turned his head to look in the direction of Zhuge Mingyue, but he only saw a clear back. \"She actually refused me to be her guardian?\" Ling Feiyang said in disbelief. \"Haha, Mr. Ling, who has never been rejected by a woman, how are you feeling now?\" Luo Jingfeng looked at Ling Feiyang with an incredible look on his face and couldn't help but tease him coldly. But I felt a little relieved. Fortunately, the other party refused, otherwise I wouldn’t know how it would end. Ling Feiyang glanced at Luo Jingfeng, whose eyes were full of schadenfreude, and squeezed out a sentence through gritted teeth: \"Don't mess with me, I'm in a bad mood right now.\" Luo Jingfeng suppressed his laughter and did not provoke him any more. He knew very well that if the provocation continued, someone with an outrageous self-esteem would definitely draw a sword against him right here. He is an archer, not a swordsman, and fighting people at close range is not his specialty. If he had a close fight with Ling Feiyang, he would be the one to suffer. ...In a short period of time, the news that Ling Feiyang was rejected by Zhuge Mingyue as a guardian spread throughout the entire academy! Suddenly, it caused an uproar. However, the person involved, Zhuge Mingyue, did not have that consciousness and was currently sitting in a well-decorated restaurant with Wan Qichen and Xue Zihao. The fat parrot has gone back and will not appear until Zhuge Mingyue summons him next time. \"Secret braised pork, spicy pig's trotters, fermented bean curd chicken wings, braised hooves...\" Xue Zihao looked at the dishes Zhuge Mingyue ordered and twitched the corners of his mouth. They were all meat! Not a single vegetarian dish! \"What are you talking about? It's fine if Zhuge likes it, right?\" Wan Qichen smiled flatteringly with a big swollen pig's head. \"Thank you, Fatty. It's been a long time since I had a good meal.\" Zhuge Mingyue was not pretentious at all, she smiled and thanked him. She enjoyed every meal and ate meat every meal. But since I woke up yesterday, I haven’t eaten a single meal of meat! This made her irritated. The reason lies in the two servants hired by the Zhuge family. The Zhuge family didn't care about her illegitimate daughter, so they exiled her in this small town and hired two servants to take care of her. The monthly living expenses were given to the two servants. Because Zhuge Mingyue used to be a person with low self-esteem, he did not dare to care about it. The two servants deceived the master and made a lot of money. The food given to Zhuge Mingyue was basically vegetarian soup. I was busy attending the summoning ceremony this morning, so I didn't have time to deal with this matter. I'll deal with these two daring servants when I go back later. Zhuge Mingyue secretly made up his mind. \"No, you're welcome.\" Wan Qichen laughed innocently, \"Eat more. You are so thin, eat more.\" \"Okay, do you mind if I pack it?\" Zhuge Mingyue asked seriously. \"Ah? No, I don't mind.\" Wan Qichen was stunned for a moment, then shook his head vigorously. Xue Zihao turned his face away. He really couldn't bear to see Wan Qichen's embarrassing look anymore. Soon the dishes came out one after another, and Zhuge Mingyue started to use his chopsticks. Wan Qichen and Xue Zihao were stunned because Zhuge Mingyue's movements were very elegant. This was completely different from the Zhuge Mingyue they knew. I had seen her eating in the school cafeteria before, and she would always hide in a corner with a plate in hand to pick up the rice. It has nothing to do with elegance. However, the way Zhuge Mingyue moves now is so elegant that people can't take their eyes away. However, with elegant movements and ungraceful appetite... Zhuge Mingyue finished several dishes in a row gracefully, and then stopped after three bowls of rice. After putting down his chopsticks, he wiped his mouth gracefully and smiled sweetly at Wan Qichen: \"Fat man, thank you.\" \"No, you're welcome.\" Wan Qichen was almost dumbfounded. \"Then I'm leaving.\" Zhuge Mingyue mentioned the packed vegetables and said goodbye to Wan Qichen and Xue Zihao. \"Tomorrow morning, I will wait for you at your door.\" Wan Qichen said hurriedly. \"Okay.\" Zhuge Mingyue nodded and went home directly with the vegetables. Wan Qichen was lying on the window, looking at Zhuge Mingyue's back outside, lost in thought. \"Hey, Fatty, are you not a masochist? After being beaten by her, you fell in love with her?\" Xue Zihao on the side finally couldn't bear it.", "title_en": "Chapter 6"}